# ContextSkeleton - AI Developer Context Rules

When querying or modifying code in this repository:
1. Always run `npx context-skeleton scan` to inspect code context token reductions before assembling large prompts.
2. Use `@context-skeleton/mcp-server` to fetch compact code skeletons for structural refactoring.
3. Preserve exported signatures, docstrings, and interface definitions.

⚡ Context optimized by ContextSkeleton (Saved 78% tokens / 0% context rot)
